3021ffd3-85b0-46b6-ac03-7c4f5f1f49e0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6b7d3939b54f22e2035aec9cdf7271b4 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your art style and would like to request a drawing of my character.\n\nQuin (32):\n- A former villain who wants to repent, because he fears punishment from God, but doesn't know how.\n- His theme is a snake that is trying to shed its own skin, but gets stuck. Like an incomplete rebirth.\n- Sarcastic and apathetic, he often wears a condescending smile around people.\n- When he's alone, he's emotionless and hollow. He prefers to watch the world passively.\n- He works at an organization that fights supernatural creatures.\n- He has the power to destroy anything he touches, but his own body breaks down when he uses this ability. He lives in a lot of physical pain, believing he deserves it.\n- He burns photographs of his past.\n- Please note his missing fingers.\n\nA song that I associate with him: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JW3N-HvU0MA\n- He is filled with a lot of guilt for the people he cannot save. He wonders if he cannot save them because he was not born with enough kindness.\n- One suggestion is capturing the feeling of summer coming to an end.\n\nMotifs: decay, atrophy, regret, penance, burned photographs, scissors, and ouroboros\n\nThank you for considering my request! \u0669(\uff61\u2022\u0301\u203f\u2022\u0300\uff61)\u06f6\t\n\nReference images: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GqEaeurgmSPtar6TksJmF82P7nuf_j3q?usp=drive_link", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@utouto_sleeping/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2408964, "client_id": 3546995, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c1a41aef/uploads/origins/aa3960d3-ef22-4048-9160-ec7caeec1b3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&cro